sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant App as "Mobile App"
    participant Tracelet as "Tracelet (location)"
    participant Backend as "Backend API"
    participant Places as "Google Places"
    participant OSM as "Overpass (OSM)"

    User->>App: Adds product to the list
    App->>Backend: GET /api/products/category?product=...
    alt product not categorized yet
        App->>User: Category picker
        User->>App: Picks category
        App->>Backend: POST /api/products/category
    end
    App->>App: Save product in local SQLite
    App->>Tracelet: Current location (fresh fix if older than 60 s)
    App->>Backend: POST /api/shops/find (products, lat/lng)
    par category-based discovery
        Backend->>Places: Nearby Search (type, rankby=distance)
        Places-->>Backend: Places results
    and neighbourhood stores
        Backend->>OSM: Overpass query (small radius)
        OSM-->>Backend: shop / pharmacy features
    end
    Backend->>Backend: Deduplicate per physical shop, merge products
    Backend-->>App: Shops with coordinates, products, source
    App->>App: Track shops as software geofences (500 m)

    loop every location update
        Tracelet-->>App: Location fix
        App->>App: Update map pin colors
        App->>App: Check proximity (ENTER / EXIT with 75 m buffer)
        opt moved 300 m or more since last fetch
            App->>Backend: POST /api/shops/find (new position)
            Backend-->>App: Updated shop list
        end
    end

    App->>App: ENTER confirmed, 5 s debounce, pick closest shop
    App-->>User: Notification "You are near (shop) which might have (products)"
    User->>App: Taps notification
    App-->>User: Map screen
